@startuml
title Record a view or download event
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Visitor" as V
participant "Web App" as W
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Rate Limiter" as R
participant "Supabase" as S

V -> W: View detail or click Download
W -> A: POST /api/templates/:identifier/{view|download}
A -> R: check(clientKey, identifier)
R --> A: allowed
A -> S: findIdentity(identifier)
S --> A: published template
A -> S: recordStatEvent(templateId, type)
S --> A: event + updated counter
A --> W: 202 event accepted
W --> V: Counter reflects the new total
note over R: Limit is 60 events/minute per client, exceeded requests return 429.
@enduml
